<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <style>
    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background-color: #111111;
      overflow: hidden;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    }
    .ticker-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      height: 60px;
      line-height: 60px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      background-color: #111111;
      border-top: 2px solid #FFD700;
    }
    .ticker {
      display: inline-block;
      padding-left: 100%;
      animation: ticker 35s linear infinite;
    }
    .ticker-item {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0 2.5rem;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #FFD700; /* Safety Yellow */
    }
    @keyframes ticker {
      0% { transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0); }
      100% { transform: translate3d(-100%, 0, 0); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="ticker-wrap">
    <div class="ticker">
      <span class="ticker-item">🚨 SITE REMINDER: Crane pick scheduled for 10:00 AM at Grid G-12 — Keep exclusion zone clear!</span>
      <span class="ticker-item">⚠️ WEATHER ALERT: High winds expected after 2:00 PM — Secure all loose rooftop decking & materials.</span>
      <span class="ticker-item">🎉 SAFETY MILESTONE: 64 Consecutive Days Without a Lost Time Injury! Keep up the great work!</span>
      <span class="ticker-item">📋 HRA REMINDER: 100% Fall Protection required for all work above 6 feet.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
